<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Manifest>
  <ID>shop_together</ID>
  <Name>多人操作：可能很混亂 / Multiplayer Control: Probably Chaotic</Name>
  <Author>Local</Author>
  <ModVersion>1.3.50</ModVersion>
  <Description>最多 8 人各自執行遊戲，共同經營房主的店。所有變動只在房主電腦發生並同步給朋友；朋友電腦不跑任何會造成分歧的遊戲邏輯，偶有偏差會自動比對並修正。加入時會檢查雙方的 mod 是否一致。外網朋友經由 Steam 連線，不需要設定路由器。</Description>
  <GameVersions><Version>1.0.0</Version></GameVersions>
  <Assemblies><Assembly>ShopTogether.dll</Assembly></Assemblies>
  <!-- Optional integrations: missing mods warn but do not prevent loading. -->
  <Prerequisites><Mod>smart_inventory_arrange</Mod><Mod>CorpPresence</Mod><Mod>bartender_action</Mod><Mod>player.shop_storage_pages</Mod><Mod>modkit.multipage_store_fix</Mod></Prerequisites>
  <Capabilities><Capability>network</Capability><Capability>steam</Capability></Capabilities>
</Manifest>
